+/// Validate a worksheet part and capture the compact planning facts for it.
+///
+/// Every snapshot that rebinds its worksheet bytes already validates the new
+/// bytes with [`worksheet_xml`]. Change 0622 captured facts only on the walk
+/// the *first* load performs, so the second commit of a snapshot chain paid
+/// the complete layout scan again. This runs the same builder over the same
+/// events of the same walk, so a rewritten worksheet carries the same facts a
+/// fresh load of those bytes would have carried, at the cost of the builder
+/// alone and no extra traversal.
